{"3563000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gig Crawler", "steam_appid": 3563000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gigcrawler</i></strong> is <strong>an extraction shooter roguelite for 1 to 4 players</strong>. Shape your Freelancer before each mission by slotting Soul Mods and unlocking weapons, then dive into procedural dungeons filled with monsters, bosses, and hidden rewards. Solo play is fully viable too, if you want to take on the gigs alone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES IN DEPTH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1 to 4 player online co-op</strong> or solo play if you prefer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Soul Modder</strong>: slot demonic fragments to define your build and weapon pool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock and discover weapons</strong> across biome-based dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural quests and missions</strong> that keep each run fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemies and bosses</strong> tied to specific biomes and factions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared rewards</strong> across runs so progress feels steady whether you play alone or with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and NPCs</strong> to find that expand the world and your Freelancer’s options</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUL MODDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Because Who Needs a Stable Identity?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to some <i>totally safe</i> tech from <i>WardCorp</i>, every Freelancer can <i>swap abilities</i> by loading Mods into their Soul Modder. <i>Roguelite randomness</i>? Nah, you’re in charge now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods define your <i>playstyle</i>: unlock skills, buffs, or total chaos. Some are rare, and some are not: all of them are yours to test. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &amp; INDIRECT COMPETITION</strong><br><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Because Misery Loves Company</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GigCrawler is best played in <i>co-op</i>, because suffering together is way more fun. Sure, you <i>can</i> go <i>solo</i>, but why would you when you can have teammates to blame? <br>Freelancer builds are flexible, and in co-op, that flexibility keeps you alive. <br>Translation: teamwork makes the dream work.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPON SYSTEM &amp; CAREER DEVELOPMENT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Climbing the Gig Ladder, One Dubious Weapon at a Time</i></strong><br>Just like real life, your career starts with absolute <i>randomness</i>. Each run throws a chaotic mix of weapons your way: sometimes you're lucky, sometimes you’re stuck swinging a rusty spoon. But hey, that’s the freelancer grind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons come in all shapes and <i>archetypes</i>, with a <i>deep system</i> to discover. A sword is melee, sure, but melee is just the beginning. The more you progress, the more you <i>tame the randomness</i>, making it easier to find the right tools for the job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember, you’ve gotta <i>earn</i> that stability. Climb the ranks, master your craft, and maybe, just maybe, you’ll stop getting stuck with a stapler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AFFINITY SYSTEM / NETWORKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>It’s Not What You Know, It’s Who You Know </strong></i><strong> </strong><br>In the gig world, <i>connections matter</i>. <br>Some NPCs will hook you up with <i>exclusive weapons</i>, <i>items</i>, or <i>mysterious things</i> (totally not stolen). Others offer... <i>unfortunate </i>surprises, like bad encounters mid-run or losing something <i>really</i> important.<br>Build your network by taking on the right quests and backing the right people. But choose wisely,  a handshake today might be a stab in the back tomorrow. <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/c3a101214919744943fce7bb49f82cc1.avif?t=1783343314\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras_big/c3a101214919744943fce7bb49f82cc1.avif?t=1783343314 width=1560 height=824 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We'll announce new characters on our Discord soon!</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR FREELANCER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Look However, Fight However</i></strong><br>Thanks to the <i>totally ethical</i> magic of the Soul Modder, your <i>appearance</i> is <i>your</i> choice. Wanna be a tiny, adorable assassin lugging around a gatling gun? Do it. A medieval tank blessed by the holy light but wielding… a rocket launcher? Go off.  <br>  <br>Your looks and abilities? Completely <i>separate</i>, <i>like they should be in real life, coff coff</i>. So shape-shift, mix it up, and create the Freelancer that truly represents <i>you</i> (or just the most cursed combination imaginable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIOME-CODED DUNGEONS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Prep Hard, Pray Harder</i></strong><br>Every GigCrawler run drops you into <i>procedurally generated dungeons</i>, new <i>enemies</i>, and <i>loot</i> that depends on what’s lurking in the shadows. Sounds fun, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here’s the kicker: your build is <i>locked in</i> before you even step foot inside. No mid-run Soul Modder swaps, no take-backs. You either prepare like a pro or end up as biome fertilizer. Choose wisely, adapt on the go, and maybe, just maybe, you won’t be <i>that</i> Freelancer who brought a spoon to a mech fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.poster.avif?t=1783343314\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.webm?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.mp4?t=1783343314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class